<title>UK: Halifax has no plans yet to follow Abbey.</title>
<headline>Halifax has no plans yet to follow Abbey.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Halifax Building Society said on Monday it had no plans at present to change its mortgage rates, but was continuing to review them.</p>
<p>Abbey National said on Sunday it would raise its variable mortgage rate by a quarter of one percentage point in a direct response to Chancellor of the Exchequer Kenneth Clarke's Budget.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom, +44 171 542 7717</p>
